            <p class="section-body">
              I handle both picture and sound — focusing on tight dialogue cuts, clean audio, and story rhythm. Outside the edit suite, I write fiction and listen to audiobooks, which gives me a bit more insight into the pacing and structure of a story during an edit.
            </p>
            <a href="mailto:vrihaspatitiwari@proton.me" class="btn btn-blue">Get in Touch</a>
